= Status, claim discipline, and the central result

The present paper has one purpose: to say exactly how far the laboratory's
Riemann-Hypothesis line has reached when its number-theoretic, geometric, and
operator-theoretic parts are placed in one dependency order.

The result is not “a pattern in the primes.” It is a sharper mathematical
boundary:

