= The one-prime Euler successor

== The successor is an exact two-arm transport

Let $p ∉ S$, $S'=S union {p}$, and define
$
  J_(S,p)=theta_(S')theta_S^(-1).
$
In the multiplicative spectral chart it is the multiplier
$
  D_p(t)=1-p^(-1/2-i t).
