body, cross-incidence, shell, two orientations, and arithmetic admission
law are all explicit.

=== The source event enters through the receiver boundary

#object-entry(elements.completed_source_event_port_transport)

The logarithmic rebase corrects the apparent initialization problem.  With
$tau=2log a$, the fixed source cut has kernel
