remaining task is to continue this same source connection without allowing
either Fredholm determinant to vanish—not to posit a new receiver after a
failure.

=== The two polarities close through one causal frame

#object-entry(elements.completed_source_volterra_frame_defect)

The apparent choice between excluding a boundary-visible unit mode and
excluding a port-dark null mode was false.  On the effective interval
