scale-invariant logarithmic amplitude $L^2(dif x/x)$.  This is a precise
appearance of the critical half in the multiplicative receiver chart.

In logarithmic time this is a literal causal integer current.  Set
$
  tau=log x,
  quad
  j_omega(tau)=J_omega(e^tau),
  quad
  w_omega(n)=frac(c_omega(n),sqrt(n)),
$
and
$
