Suzuki's weighted-summatory theorem gives a second exact source statement:
RH is equivalent to eventual nonnegativity of
$h_omega^("⟨1⟩")$ for every $0<omega<1/2$
@suzuki2012monotonicity.  This does *not* require the causal residual
